{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo version of <i>Mutavole</i> offers a preview of the core gameplay experience. In this demo, players can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>one playable character</strong> to enter a combat zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against <strong>waves of enemies</strong> to collect valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gathered resources to <strong>upgrade the character</strong> and <strong>unlock performance animations</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that this demo includes <strong>one level and one playable character</strong>, with limited progression options. The full version will feature <strong>additional characters, levels, and expanded gameplay mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy this early look at <i>Mutavole</i>! Your feedback is greatly appreciated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635390?t=1759237392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635390/6b292f5ae5e09b601b44b9f0d70c000eaf163c5c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759237392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635390/620e46ef079952bb675452061edd42744957a19f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759237392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635390/620e46ef079952bb675452061edd42744957a19f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759237392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit sexual content, including nudity, sexual acts, and scenes involving non-consensual interactions, BDSM themes, and sexual activities with non-human creatures. The demo version features an optional animated scene where a tentacle creature touches a nude female characte